WEBVTT

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.800
(SHRIEKS)

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.240
LITTLE MONSTERS:
♪ The neck bone's connected

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.680
♪ To the head bone

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.360
♪ The head bone's connected
to the horn bone

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.000
♪ The horn bone's right above
the wing bones ♪

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.880
(LITTLE MONSTERS GIGGLING)

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.680
-(GROWLS)
-Ah!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.320
-I scared you!
-No, you didn't.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.400
Okay! Remember our field trip rules,
everyone.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.200
Uh, no pushing, no biting,
and no fire breathing!

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.280
-(ROARS)
-What did I just say?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.880
Eighteen, nineteen...

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.200
Okay, we're missing one.
Who are we missing?

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.680
Oh. Mike Wazowski.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.720
Thanks, Joe.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.560
Good luck finishing
your crossword puzzle.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.680
-Sorry, Michael. I didn't see you.
-That's okay.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.360
When I was on the bus, I found a nickel!

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.160
I wish I had pockets.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.280
Okay, everyone, partner up.
Get your field trip buddy.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.640
Jeremy! You and me? Okay, no biggie.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.760
Hailey? No? Pairing up with Claire?
Great choice. She's a good egg.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.160
Russell.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.640
Mike? Wazowski?

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.680
We car-pool?

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.560
-We're cousins.
-BOTH: Hey!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.840
Okay. Good catching up.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.800
Well, Michael, it looks like
it's you and me again.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.120
(AGREES NERVOUSLY)

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.360
(LITTLE MONSTERS
CHATTERING EXCITEDLY)

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.240
Come on, Karen. We're falling behind.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.000
(LAUGHING)
Please don't call me Karen.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.240
TOUR GUIDE:
Now, stay close together.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:25.120
We're entering a very dangerous area.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.840
Welcome to the Scare Floor.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.320
LITTLE MONSTERS: Wow!

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.720
(MALE MONSTER
CHATTERING ON PA)

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.520
(WORKERS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.200
TOUR GUIDE: This is where
we collect the Scream Energy

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.200
-to power our whole world.
-(ALL GASP)

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:40.480
And can anyone tell me
whose job it is to go get that scream?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.840
-ALL: Scarers!
-That's right!

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.360
Now, which one of you can
give me the scariest roar?

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.680
ALL: Me, me, me!

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.000
Oh! Sir! Right here! Little green guy,

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.360
-two o'clock!
-(ROARS)

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.040
No, it's like this. (ROARS)

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.480
-Hey, guys, watch this one.
-(ROARS)

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.560
Hey, I got a really good...

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.120
(BOTH ROARING)

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.560
(ROARS LOUDLY)

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.720
ALL: (GASPING) Wow!

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.880
Whoa.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:17.040
Well, hey there, kids.
Are you on a tour with your school?

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.160
-Yeah!
-MRS. GRAVES: Yes.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:22.240
We're here to learn about Scream
Energy and what it takes to be a Scarer.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.440
Well, hey, you're in luck,
because I just happen to be a Scarer.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.600
I learned everything
I know from my school,

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.400
Monsters University.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.760
Whoa.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.080
It's the best Scaring School there is.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.280
You wish! Fear Tech's the best.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:39.400
Okay. You guys watch us and tell me
which school's the best. All right?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.040
(WHISPERS) MU is.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.680
(BELL RINGING)

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.200
MALE SCARER SUPERVISOR:
Let's go, everybody!

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.920
FEMALE MONSTER ON PA:
West coast coming online.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.600
Scarers coming out.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.080
TOUR GUIDE: Oops. Stop right there.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.120
Don't cross over that safety line.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.760
Human children are extremely toxic.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.480
-Look at that!
-(LITTLE MONSTERS CHATTERING)

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.920
Whoa! Hey, guys, watch the eye! Ow!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.400
LITTLE MONSTER 1:
Look at that! It's amazing!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.720
LITTLE MONSTER 2: I know!

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.280
ALL: Wow!
MIKE: Excuse me. Fellas.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:06.800
How about we do
tallest in the back? (GASPS)

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.400
(CHATTERING CONTINUES)

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.120
LITTLE MONSTER 3:
Look, he's going to

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.440
-do a real Scare!
-(PANTING)

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.680
-(ROARS)
-(MIKE SIGHS)

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.400
-Cool. I want to be a Scarer.
-Yeah. Me, too.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.760
Come on, guys. I want to see.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.880
Out of the way, Wazowski.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.880
You don't belong on a Scare Floor.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.160
(RATTLING)

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:33.040
Brian! Do not step over the line.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.920
Mrs. Graves, Michael went over the line.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.280
(GASPS) Michael!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.640
(DOOR CREAKING)

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.000
MOTHER: See? I told you. He's fine.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.360
FATHER: Well,
I thought I heard something.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.560
(SCRATCHING)

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.720
(BOY GASPS)

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.760
(BOY SCREAMS)

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:42.880
(ALL GASP)

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.560
What?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.560
-(ALL CHATTERING)
-Are you okay?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.720
FEMALE MONSTER:
You could have gotten hurt!

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.560
I don't understand
how this could happen!

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.720
That was real dangerous, kid.
I didn't even know you were in there.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.760
Wow. I didn't even know
you were in there.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.040
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:11.960
Not bad, kid.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.640
Michael, what do you have
to say for yourself?

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.920
How do I become a Scarer?

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.000
(MARCHING BAND PLAYING)

